{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>In the bowl</b> — like צלוחית חדשה (a small bowl), and the meaning is as though his hand is hidden in the bowl." "<b>He will not bring it back</b> — for he will find nothing to eat; therefore a person must seek his sustenance and not be lazy."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:41.798577327Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}